      "id": "n-edb708d71331",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 09 Discovery Plan\n\nSix proposed work packages. Owners and dates remain unassigned until confirmed.\n\n**Status labels are part of the content; color is not the only status signal.**",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 3000,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n-7787626466c1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## WP01 - TOP System Review\n\n**Evidence**\nScreens, configuration, modules, reports\n\n**Deliverable**\nAS-IS capability matrix\n\nOwner/date: **TO IDENTIFY**",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n-a656345ab675",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## WP02 - SOP / JD Review\n\n**Evidence**\nRepresentative controlled documents\n\n**Deliverable**\nResponsibility map\n\nOwner/date: **TO IDENTIFY**",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n-d7792fde74aa",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## WP03 - KPI Definition Assessment\n\n**Evidence**\nCatalogue, formulas, sources, approvals\n\n**Deliverable**\nKPI gap report\n\nOwner/date: **TO IDENTIFY**",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n-63633e1898dc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## WP04 - Work Done & Data Discovery\n\n**Evidence**\nTask/evidence/source/history samples\n\n**Deliverable**\nMeasurement feasibility\n\nOwner/date: **TO IDENTIFY**",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 950,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n-4103d4e1c89a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## WP05 - TO-BE Validation\n\n**Evidence**\nWorkshops and golden cases\n\n**Deliverable**\nValidated process/rules\n\nOwner/date: **TO IDENTIFY**",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 950,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
